      "The seam parts like a pair of doors, and a long corridor of dry grey stone runs back under the archive, lined with cages and kennels, hundreds of them, all empty. The air is cold and smells of iron.",
      "Ruoshui’s master walled this corridor, and over the first cage he wrote that a hound is a promise made by a master to the dark. A promise never called is a promise never broken, and the cages are the sect’s unspent loyalty.",
